/line></svg></button></div></header><main><section class=\"relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden pt-20\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0\"><img alt=\"TradingView Chart Background\" fetchPriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover opacity-30\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/Banner.png\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#0a0e1a]/50 via-[#0a0e1a]/70 to-[#0a0e1a]\"></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 py-20 text-center\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px) translateZ(0)\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#2962ff]/20 border border-[#2962ff]/50 rounded-full px-4 py-2 mb-8\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trending-up text-[#2962ff]\"><polyline points=\"22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17\"></polyline><polyline points=\"16 7 22 7 22 13\"></polyline></svg><span class=\"text-sm text-white/80\">Real-Time Order Flow Detection</span></div><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-bold mb-6 leading-tight\">See the Orders<br/><span class=\"text-[#2962ff]\">Behind the Move.</span></h1><p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-white/70 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 leading-relaxed\">OrderFlow Events detects hidden institutional activity in real time — Iceberg Orders, Sweeps, Absorptions and Volume Spikes — and displays them live directly in your TradingView workspace.</p><a href=\"https://whop.com/orderflowzones/orderflow-events-iceberg-live-signals/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#2962ff] hover:bg-[#1e4bd8] text-white font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded-lg text-lg transition-all hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#2962ff]/30 animate-pulse-glow\">Get Started<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"mt-16 relative\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px) translateZ(0)\"><div class=\"relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 shadow-2xl shadow-[#2962ff]/10\"><div class=\"aspect-video relative bg-[#0a0e1a]\"><img alt=\"OrderFlow Events Dashboard\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/BeispielDunkel.png\"/></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 px-6 bg-[#0d111f] transition-all duration-700 opacity-0 translate-y-10\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\"><div><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[#f0b429] mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-eye\"><path d=\"M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider\">What is OrderFlow Events?</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6\">Trade What the Market Is <span class=\"text-[#2962ff]\">Really Doing.</span></h2><p class=\"text-white/70 text-lg leading-relaxed\">Most traders only see price. OrderFlow Events shows you what&#x27;s happening beneath the surface. Our proprietary algorithms analyze live exchange data tick by tick — detecting patterns that reveal where large players are actively working orders, absorbing supply, or aggressively sweeping liquidity.</p><p class=\"text-white/70 text-lg leading-relaxed mt-4\">The result: <span class=\"text-white font-semibold\">actionable signals delivered to your screen in real time</span>, before the move becomes obvious.</p></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 shadow-xl\"><div class=\"aspect-[4/3] relative bg-[#0a0e1a]\"><img alt=\"OrderFlow Settings Panel\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/SettigsBlackWhite.png\"/></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"signals\" class=\"py-20 px-6  transition-all duration-700 opacity-0 translate-y-10\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4\">Five Signals. <span class=\"text-[#f0b429]\">One Edge.</span></h2><p class=\"text-white/60 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Our detection algorithms identify five distinct types of institutional order flow patterns.</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"group bg-[#0d111f] border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-[#2962ff]/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-[#2962ff]/10 hover:-translate-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-2xl\" style=\"background-color:#2962ff20\">🏔️</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">Iceberg Orders</h3></div><p class=\"text-white/60 leading-relaxed\">Large hidden orders being worked quietly at a price level. Smart money doesn&#x27;t show its hand — but we find it.</p></div><div class=\"group bg-[#0d111f] border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-[#2962ff]/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-[#2962ff]/10 hover:-translate-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-2xl\" style=\"background-color:#f0b42920\">⚡</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">Sweeps</h3></div><p class=\"text-white/60 leading-relaxed\">Aggressive market orders clearing multiple price levels. A sweep often signals the start of a directional move.</p></div><div class=\"group bg-[#0d111f] border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-[#2962ff]/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-[#2962ff]/10 hover:-translate-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-2xl\" style=\"background-color:#22c55e20\">🛡️</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">Absorption</h3></div><p class=\"text-white/60 leading-relaxed\">When large limit orders silently absorb aggressive flow. Price stalls. A reversal may follow.</p></div><div class=\"group bg-[#0d111f] border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-[#2962ff]/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-[#2962ff]/10 hover:-translate-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-2xl\" style=\"background-color:#ef444420\">🔥</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">Volume Spikes</h3></div><p class=\"text-white/60 leading-relaxed\">Unusual bursts of volume at key levels. Something is happening — and you&#x27;ll know first.</p></div><div class=\"group bg-[#0d111f] border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-[#2962ff]/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-[#2962ff]/10 hover:-translate-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-2xl\" style=\"background-color:#a855f720\">✋</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">Large Fills</h3></div><p class=\"text-white/60 leading-relaxed\">Significant executed volume at a single price. Institutional footprints hiding in plain sight.</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"how-it-works\" class=\"py-20 px-6 bg-[#0d111f] transition-all duration-700 opacity-0 translate-y-10\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4\">Zero Setup. <span class=\"text-[#2962ff]\">Pure Signal.</span></h2><p class=\"text-white/60 text-lg max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\">OrderFlow Events runs entirely in the background. Our backend processes live market data 24/5, extracts institutional order flow signals through advanced algorithmic detection, and streams them directly to your TradingView chart via a secure WebSocket connection.</p><p class=\"text-white/80 mt-4\">No manual configuration. No chart calibration. No delays. Just open TradingView — and the signals are there.</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-16\"><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"bg-[#0a0e1a] border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-8 text-center hover:border-[#2962ff]/50 transition-all\"><div class=\"text-[#f0b429] text-sm font-bold mb-4\">01</div><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-[#2962ff]/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-credit-card text-[#2962ff]\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"14\" x=\"2\" y=\"5\" rx=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"2\" x2=\"22\" y1=\"10\" y2=\"10\"></line></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Subscribe</h3><p class=\"text-white/60\">Choose your plan and select your markets.</p></div><div class=\"hidden md:block absolute top-1/2 -right-4 w-8 h-0.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#2962ff] to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"bg-[#0a0e1a] border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-8 text-center hover:border-[#2962ff]/50 transition-all\"><div class=\"text-[#f0b429] text-sm font-bold mb-4\">02</div><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-[#2962ff]/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download text-[#2962ff]\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"15\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Install</h3><p class=\"text-white/60\">Add the Chrome Extension in seconds.</p></div><div class=\"hidden md:block absolute top-1/2 -right-4 w-8 h-0.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#2962ff] to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"bg-[#0a0e1a] border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-8 text-center hover:border-[#2962ff]/50 transition-all\"><div class=\"text-[#f0b429] text-sm font-bold mb-4\">03</div><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-[#2962ff]/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chart-line text-[#2962ff]\"><path d=\"M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16\"></path><path d=\"m19 9-5 5-4-4-3 3\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Trade</h3><p class=\"text-white/60\">See live order flow signals directly on TradingView.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10\"><div class=\"aspect-video relative bg-[#0a0e1a]\"><img alt=\"OrderFlow Events Light Theme\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/BeispielHell.png\"/></div></div></div></section><section id=\"markets\" class=\"py-20 px-6  transition-all duration-700 opacity-0 translate-y-10\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4\">Built for the Markets <span class=\"text-[#f0b429]\">That Matter.</span></h2><p class=\"text-white/60 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Full support for both Futures and CFD instruments — with automatic price conversion.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4\"><div class=\"group bg-[#0d111f] border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-6 text-center hover:border-[#2962ff]/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-4 rounded-full overflow-hidden bg-[#0a0e1a] border border-white/10 relative\"><img alt=\"S&amp;P 500 Futures\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/ES_futures.png\"/></div><div class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#2962ff] mb-1\">ES</div><div class=\"text-sm text-white/60\">S&amp;P 500 Futures</div></div><div class=\"group bg-[#0d111f] border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-6 text-center hover:border-[#2962ff]/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-4 rounded-full overflow-hidden bg-[#0a0e1a] border border-white/10 relative\"><img alt=\"Nasdaq 100 Futures\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/NQ_futures.png\"/></div><div class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#2962ff] mb-1\">NQ</div><div class=\"text-sm text-white/60\">Nasdaq 100 Futures</div></div><div class=\"group bg-[#0d111f] border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-6 text-center hover:border-[#2962ff]/50 transition-all duration-300 h